%%{init: {"theme": "neutral", "fontFamily": "Arial, sans-serif", "htmlLabels": false, "flowchart": {"htmlLabels": false}}}%%
flowchart TB
    accTitle: Proposed DUAL-STRIKE architecture with one connected lane
    accDescr: Existing Pi services and gateway serve one connected string controller, paired sensor boards and a camera. Independent protective hardware acts on the motor and retention mechanism. String-specific functions remain proposed and unimplemented.
    subgraph pi["Raspberry Pi / lane-compute installation"]
        bridge["uart_bridge<br/>Sole serial owner"]
        game["state_machine<br/>Game and scoring authority"]
        vision["vision<br/>Proposed stability and verification"]
        game -->|"HTTP commands"| bridge
        bridge -->|"WebSocket events"| game
        bridge -->|"WebSocket beam events"| vision
        game -->|"Proposed correlated capture requests"| vision
        vision -->|"HTTP observations and verification outcomes"| game
    end
    camera["USB camera<br/>One per lane"] -->|"Images"| vision
    bridge <-->|"Framed UART: translated messages"| gateway["Existing gateway_node<br/>Proposed lane-aware string routing"]
    gateway <-->|"ESP-NOW and shared RS485"| controller["New string_pinsetter_node<br/>Local motion and interlock supervision"]
    foul["Existing foul_node<br/>One board per lane pair"] -->|"Lane-tagged events over both transports"| gateway
    speed["Existing speed_node<br/>One board per lane pair"] -->|"Lane-tagged events over both transports"| gateway
    controller -->|"Drive and retention commands"| hardware["Motor and 10 retention channels<br/>Position and tension feedback"]
    hardware -->|"Local feedback"| controller
    safety["Independent hardwired safety<br/>E-stop, guards, energy isolation<br/>Load retention and containment"] ==>|"Protective functions independent of software"| hardware
    safety -.->|"Diagnostic monitoring only"| controller
